		*p: currdbf		&& Previously selected table.
		*p: fnspectext
		*p: group		&& Holds spec group ex..ASTM
		*p: nconnhandle
		*p: opened		&& Opened in load.
		*p: openedhardness
		*p: spec		&& Hold spec.
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

